; UseLLVMpipe - AROS's software GL through the llvmpipe driver in this drawer's Drivers instead of softpipe,
; until the system is started again. Execute it in the FlightGear drawer before fgfs:
;   CD <the FlightGear drawer>
;   Execute UseLLVMpipe
;   fgfs
; A display with a GL driver of its own (NVidia, AMD) is not affected.
Assign LIBS: Drivers ADD
SetEnv SYS/Gallium.default llvmpipe
Avail FLUSH >NIL:
